 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "El Tết: la fiesta más importante",
    "@en": "The Tết: the most important party"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "**Tết** (o **Tết Nguyên Đán**) es el Año Nuevo según el **âm lịch** (calendario lunar). Suele caer entre finales de enero y febrero (**dương lịch** = calendario solar). Todo el país descansa casi una semana.",
     "@en": "**Tết** (or **Tết Nguyên Đán**) is the New Year according to the **âm lịch** (lunar calendar). It usually falls between the end of January and February (**dương lịch** = solar calendar). The whole country has almost a week's rest."
    },
    {
     "@es": "Todo el mundo intenta **về quê ăn Tết** = volver a su tierra a celebrar el Tết con la familia. ¡Si vas con tu mujer, es tu gran examen familiar!",
     "@en": "Everybody's trying **về quê ăn Tết** = return to your land to celebrate the Tết with the family. If you go with your wife, it's your big family exam!"
    },
    {
     "@es": "Se come **bánh chưng** (pastel cuadrado de arroz glutinoso con carne y judías), se compran flores (**hoa đào** en el norte, **hoa mai** en el sur) y se hacen ofrendas a los antepasados (**cúng tổ tiên**).",
     "@en": "**bánh chưng** (glutinous rice square cake with meat and beans) is eaten, flowers are bought (**hoa đào** in the north, **hoa mai** in the south) and offerings are made to the ancestors (**cúng tổ tiên**)."
    },
    {
     "@es": "**xông nhà**: la primera persona que entra en una casa el día 1 trae suerte (o mala suerte) para todo el año. A los niños se les da **lì xì** (dinero en sobre rojo).",
     "@en": "**xông nhà**: The first person to enter a house on day 1 brings luck (or bad luck) for the whole year. Children are given **lì xì** (money in red envelope)."
    },
    {
     "@es": "• La frase clave: **Chúc mừng năm mới!** = ¡Feliz año nuevo!",
     "@en": "• The key phrase: **Chúc mừng năm mới!** = Happy New Year!"
    }
   ]
  },
